      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TIGERSWAND (4) has been racing well of late. Finished fourth at his latest appearance over 1609m at this track, beaten 3.5 metres. Meets a comparable field and can take this out. KYCORDEN (9) had put together a string of strong performances and was again in fine form last start when he finished third over 1720m at Penrith, beaten 7 metres. Drawn to enjoy a nice run, with luck possibly playing a role at some point. Must raise the bar but an overdue win is on the cards. SLICK AND SUAVE (1) is better than his last-start eighth over 1609m at Menangle. CARRERA BENICIO NZ (2) is a three-year-old gelding from the Dylan Xerri stable on debut. No excuses from this advantageous draw. Well-placed to score at his first appearance.",
